{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.0#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.0", "speaker_jp": "エチカ", "speaker_en": "Echika", "pid": "ECHIKA", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「イーリス、いつもアシストありがとう。\n　ここに活躍を表彰するね」", "en": "「Thanks so much for all the assistance, Iris. We're here to formally\n　 recognize that.」", "jp_bytes": 97}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.1#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.1", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「じーん…」", "en": "「Mmhmm...」", "jp_bytes": 18}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.2#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.2", "speaker_jp": "エチカ", "speaker_en": "Echika", "pid": "ECHIKA", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「どうしたの？」", "en": "「Is something wrong?」", "jp_bytes": 24}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.3#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.3", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「うれしさをかみしめてんの。\n　あたし、こんな風に褒められたり、\n　感謝されたりって慣れてないから」", "en": "「Nah, just trying to contain my excitement. I haven't gotten a lot of\n　 recognition or appreciation like this before, ya know.」", "jp_bytes": 146}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.4#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.4", "speaker_jp": "エチカ", "speaker_en": "Echika", "pid": "ECHIKA", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「詳しく聞いてなかったけど、\n　過酷な経験をしてきたのね…」", "en": "「I see... I don't know all the details, but it sounds like you've had\n　a hard life.」", "jp_bytes": 88}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.5#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.5", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「過酷なんてもんじゃないよ！\n　コキ使われるだけじゃなく、\n　八つ当たりも日常茶飯事！」", "en": "「You don't know the half of it! It was bad enough I was getting worked\n　to the bone, but I also had to be a stress ball every single day!」", "jp_bytes": 128}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.6#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.6", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「上の人の虫の居所が悪ければ、\n　粛清されちゃう事もあったんだから！」", "en": "「And if my boss was in an EXTRA bad mood, I'd get purged on top of\n　all that!」", "jp_bytes": 103}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.7#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.7", "speaker_jp": "エチカ", "speaker_en": "Echika", "pid": "ECHIKA", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「粛清…」", "en": "「...\"Purged\"?」", "jp_bytes": 15}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.8#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.8", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「それに比べれば、\n　エーアデントは天国だよ！」", "en": "「After all that, the A. Advent feels like paradise!」", "jp_bytes": 70}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:1.9#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "1.9", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「エチカは優しくて面白いし、\n　アニーナ先生はいろんな事を教えてくれるし、\n　ミナは何だかんだ言っても遊んでくれるしね！」", "en": "「You're always so nice to me, and fun to be around, too. And I'm learning\n　so much from Annina, and Mina complains, but she still plays with me!」", "jp_bytes": 179}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.0#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.0", "speaker_jp": "エチカ", "speaker_en": "Echika", "pid": "ECHIKA", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「ここでの暮らしを楽しんでくれてるなら\n　私も嬉しいよ」", "en": "「Well, I'm happy to hear you're enjoying your life here.」", "jp_bytes": 82}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.1#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.1", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「だったら、あたし…\n　もっと働いちゃうよ」", "en": "「So I, um... I want to help out more.」", "jp_bytes": 64}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.2#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.2", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「エチカのお屋敷の花園の世話…\n　あたしにやらせてくれないかな」", "en": "「Would you let me take care of the flower garden on your property?」", "jp_bytes": 94}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.3#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.3", "speaker_jp": "エチカ", "speaker_en": "Echika", "pid": "ECHIKA", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「いいよ。\n　イーリスはお花が好きなの？」", "en": "「It would be my pleasure. Do you like flowers, Iris?」", "jp_bytes": 61}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.4#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.4", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「うん…」", "en": "「Yeah.」", "jp_bytes": 15}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.5#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.5", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「あたし、お花に囲まれて暮らしてたから…」", "en": "「I used to be surrounded by them.」", "jp_bytes": 63}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.6#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.6", "speaker_jp": "エチカ", "speaker_en": "Echika", "pid": "ECHIKA", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「じゃあ、お世話も慣れてるね。\n　任せるよ、イーリス」", "en": "「Then you must know how to care for them. They're all yours, Iris.」", "jp_bytes": 79}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.7#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.7", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "「ありがとう！\n　あたし、頑張って\n　綺麗な花をたくさん咲かせるね！」", "en": "「Thanks! I'll work super hard every day and make a lot of them bloom\n　beautifully!」", "jp_bytes": 101}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.8#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.8", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "（サイクラミノス様、オルキダケア様…\n　あたし、楽しくやってるよ）", "en": "（Great Cyclaminos, Great Orchidacea... I'm having fun now.）", "jp_bytes": 97}
{"id": "scenario:cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua:2.9#1", "file": "cse20_3738_0999900a_sdemo.lua", "sibling": null, "pack": "base", "scene": "cse20_3738_0999900a", "kind": "sdemo", "string_id": "2.9", "speaker_jp": "イーリス", "speaker_en": "Iris", "pid": "IRIS_30", "table": 1, "branch": null, "jp": "（神文明エーオスは終わっちゃったけど、\n　みんなが好きだったお花は\n　いろんな世界で咲かせるからね）", "en": "（The Divine Civilization Aos may be history, but... I'll spread the flowers\n　you all loved so much across all the worlds, okay?）", "jp_bytes": 146}
